      "writtenOn": "2020-02-04T23:06:44Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is kasa compute  dependant on newton_fit_accumulate?\nDoes it make sense for kasa_accumulate to return true when enough samples are accumulated?",
      "revId": "3639d652d05884b4741ce23c5965667876a7839d",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba",
      "unresolved": true
